WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Run your trader from Discord. About five minutes, and you only do it once.

00:06.000 --> 00:16.000
A Discord account, a server of your own, and GoNuts already working in game.

00:16.000 --> 00:26.000
Open the Discord developer page and make a new application. The name is up to you.

00:26.000 --> 00:37.000
The token is the bot's password. Copy it now: Discord only shows it once.

00:37.000 --> 00:50.000
Make an invite link with three permissions, open it, and pick your server.

00:50.000 --> 00:59.000
Developer Mode lets you copy the ids that GoNuts asks for.

00:59.000 --> 01:09.000
Right-click the channel for its id, then right-click your own name for yours.

01:09.000 --> 01:19.000
In game press B, open Autopilot, and click the top right button twice.

01:19.000 --> 01:30.000
Paste the token, the channel id and your user id, then press Save.

01:30.000 --> 01:42.000
The panel shows up in your channel. Pick a page from the dropdown, and Start or Stop from the buttons.

01:42.000 --> 01:51.000
Check the three permissions, both ids, and the token. Then Save again.
